VFO Selection help

Available choices depend on your radio, such as VFO A/B or Main/Sub. Opening reads the current selection where available, without changing it.

Some radios allow VFO selection but cannot report the current choice. YAC announces Unknown in that case. Opening this control does not change the selection.

Full stop) Select the next choice.
Comma) Select the previous choice.
v) Select the next choice.
h) Read this help.
q) Quit and save.

